          "description": "安全组规则ID。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ip_version": {
          "description": "IP协议类型。取值范围:\n* 4\n* 6",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ip_protocol": {
          "description": "协议类型,取值范围:ICMP,TCP,UDP,Any,Any表示支持所有协议。\n\n协议类型为ICMPV4时,起始端口值和结束端口值取值范围如下(格式:ICMP协议类型名称(port_range_min, port_range_max)):\n* Any(-1, -1)\n* Echo(8, 0)\n* Echo reply(0, 0)\n* Fragment need DF set(3, 4)\n* Host redirect(5, 1)\n* Host TOS redirect(5, 3)\n* Host unreachable(3, 1)\n* Information reply(16, 0)\n* Information request(15, 0)\n* Net redirect(5, 0)\n* Net TOS redirect(5, 2)\n* Net unreachable(3, 0)\n* Parameter problem(12, 0)\n* Port unreachable(3, 3)\n* Protocol unreachable(3, 2)\n* Reassembly timeout(11, 1)\n* Source quench(4, 0)\n* Source route failed(3, 5)\n* Timestamp reply(14, 0)\n* Timestamp request(13, 0)\n* TTL exceeded(11, 0)\nICMPV6的type和code取值范围是-1~255,type和code取值-1表示Any",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ip_ranges": {
          "description": "远端IP地址,和remote_group_id互斥,取值范围:子网格式,或者IP段格式。\n* IPv4示例:子网格式:192.168.5.0/255.255.255.0;IP段格式:192.168.5.0-192.168.5.255\n* IPv6示例:子网格式:fc00::/7;IP段格式:fc00::0-fc00::7",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "security_group_id": {
          "description": "对端安全组ID和remote_ip_range互斥。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "from_port": {
          "description": "起始端口值。\n* 取值范围:0~65535\n* 协议类型为ICMP时:必须为protocol字段说明中定义的特定端口值。\n* 协议类型为TCP或UDP时:取值不能大于port_range_max的值。\n* 协议类型为Any时:取值必须为-1。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "to_port": {
          "description": "结束端口值。\n* 取值范围:0~65535\n* 协议类型为ICMP时:必须为protocol字段说明中定义的特定端口值。\n* 协议类型为TCP或UDP时:取值不能小于port_range_min的值。\n* 协议类型为Any时:取值必须为-1。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "direction": {
          "description": "出入控制方向。取值范围:\n* 1: 出方向\n* 0: 入方向",
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
